      <!-- Main Body Privacy Policy -->
      <div style="grid-column: span 8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-xl);">
        <div>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">1. Our Core Philosophy</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            We believe that browsing the web should not require surrendering your personal privacy. <strong>Camwyn &amp; Co.</strong> operates on a zero-tracking, static Jamstack model. We do not run third-party tracking scripts, cross-site behavioral ads, or intrusive analytics SDKs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">2. Information Storage &amp; Local Persistence</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
            This site uses client-side JavaScript (Alpine.js) to store interactive states—such as your <strong>Adventure Compass</strong> quiz archetype result—directly inside your browser's <code>localStorage</code> (key: <code>compassResult</code>).
          </p>
          <ul style="list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); line-height: 1.6;">
            <li>This data remains <strong>100% local to your device</strong> and browser.</li>
            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> transmit your quiz answers or archetype key to any external database or analytics server.</li>
            <li>You can clear this stored data at any time simply by clearing your browser cache or site data.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">3. Form Submissions &amp; Correspondence</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            When you reach out via our intake form on <em>The Next Thing</em> or email us directly at <code>hello@camwyn.com</code>, we receive the information you choose to provide (such as your name, email address, and project notes). We use this information solely to respond to your inquiry and discuss potential collaboration. We never sell, rent, or trade your contact information to third parties.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">4. Server Logs &amp; CDN Infrastructure</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Like all web traffic, our static Content Delivery Network (CDN) host automatically logs standard HTTP access requests (such as your IP address, browser type, and timestamp) to deliver site assets securely and prevent DDoS attacks. These logs are used purely for security and performance maintenance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">5. Your Rights &amp; Data Control</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Because we do not maintain central user accounts or tracking databases, we hold no personal profile data about your browsing behavior. If you have sent us an email or form submission and would like your message history deleted, simply email us at <a href="mailto:hello@camwyn.com" style="color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: underline;">hello@camwyn.com</a> and we will gladly fulfill your request.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">6. Contact Us</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            If you have any questions or concerns regarding our privacy practices, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@camwyn.com" style="color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: underline;">hello@camwyn.com</a>.
          </p>
